  "_note": "NS16C550 / PC16550D UART (National Semiconductor / TI). Pin table from TI PC16550D datasheet (SNLS378F). DIP-40 package. Intel bus mode adopted: WRB (pin 18, /WR1 write strobe active low), WR2B (pin 19, /WR2), RDB (pin 21, /RD1 read strobe active low), RD2B (pin 22, /RD2). In Intel mode tie WR2B and RD2B low to use WRB/RDB as active-low strobes. CSB (pin 14, /CS2 active low, uniform memory-select naming), CS0 (pin 12, active high), CS1 (pin 13, active high). 8-bit data bus (D0-D7), 3-bit register address (A0-A2). Serial: SIN (pin 10), SOUT (pin 11). Modem: RTSB/CTSB/DTRB/DSRB/DCDB/RIB (all active low). IRQ (pin 36, INTR active high). XIN/XOUT (pins 16-17, oscillator). MR (pin 39, master reset active high). NC pins 37-38. VSS=pin 20, VCC=pin 40.",
